  "title": "The Definitive Hand Embroidery Guide: Zardozi, Dabka, Naqshi, and Marori Work Decoded for Diaspora Buyers",
  "excerpt": "Decode authentic Mughal handwork. Learn to identify 3D French bullion wire, micro-pearl settings, and vasli relief versus synthetic machine tilla glare.",
